      "x": 578,
      "y": 377.0,
      "width": 215.875,
      "height": 27
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "区分未知、自由与占用；",
      "x": 578,
      "y": 422.18,
      "width": 219.828125,
      "height": 20
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "只在已知安全空间走。",
      "x": 578,
      "y": 448.98,
      "width": 199.84375,
      "height": 20
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "探索目标与路径",
      "x": 997,
      "y": 377.0,
      "width": 188.890625,
      "height": 27
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "优先可看见更多未知的位置；",
      "x": 997,
      "y": 422.18,
      "width": 259.796875,
      "height": 20
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "计入路程和障碍遮挡。",
      "x": 997,
      "y": 448.98,
      "width": 199.84375,
      "height": 20
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "多角度补扫 → 返航 → 保存",
      "x": 557,
      "y": 651.0,
      "width": 333.375,
      "height": 28
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "已看表面的质量检查",
      "x": 578,
      "y": 725.0,
      "width": 242.859375,
      "height": 27
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "观察太少就换位置补扫；",
      "x": 578,
      "y": 770.18,
      "width": 242.0,
      "height": 22
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "发现新通道可恢复探索。",
      "x": 578,
      "y": 799.66,
      "width": 242.0,
      "height": 22
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "任务结束与保存确认",
      "x": 997,
      "y": 725.0,
      "width": 242.859375,
      "height": 27
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "回到起点，持续驻留5秒；",
      "x": 997,
      "y": 770.18,
      "width": 254.203125,
      "height": 22
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
      "text": "地图保存成功后才结束。",
      "x": 997,
      "y": 799.66,
      "width": 242.0,
      "height": 22
    },
    {
      "page": 1,
